    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        439.97161865234375,
        513.426025390625,
        453.3231201171875
      ],
      "text": "In addition to recording in the local TB treatment register, it is important to maintain",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        455.9681091308594,
        513.41455078125,
        469.3196105957031
      ],
      "text": "facility medical records and to include information on TB screening, results and treatment",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        471.964599609375,
        513.4545288085938,
        485.3231201171875
      ],
      "text": "(preventive or curative) in child health documents.  This will improve continuity of care and  1",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04501342773438,
        487.9681091308594,
        513.40869140625,
        501.3196105957031
      ],
      "text": "communication between health services. Children should also be included in integrated",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04501342773438,
        503.964599609375,
        513.4547119140625,
        517.3161010742188
      ],
      "text": "TB/HIV activities. It is important to establish and maintain linkages between TB and HIV",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04501342773438,
        519.9611206054688,
        513.3856811523438,
        533.3126220703125
      ],
      "text": "care, recording and reporting in HIV care and treatment settings; ART registers should",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04501342773438,
        535.9575805664062,
        353.4549865722656,
        549.30908203125
      ],
      "text": "include records of TB screening and IPT as well as CPT.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04501342773438,
        560.4640502929688,
        513.3856201171875,
        573.8155517578125
      ],
      "text": "The use of a contact screening register, as suggested in Chapter 5, should be encouraged.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04501342773438,
        576.4605712890625,
        513.4545288085938,
        589.8120727539062
      ],
      "text": "Important screening indicators include the number of children screened, symptoms",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04501342773438,
        592.4570922851562,
        513.4317016601562,
        605.80859375
      ],
      "text": "suggestive of TB, the age and HIV status of child contacts, and the type of treatment",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04501342773438,
        608.45361328125,
        513.4431762695312,
        621.8051147460938
      ],
      "text": "each child has received (IPT or anti-TB treatment). The ratio of the number of sputum",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04501342773438,
        624.4501342773438,
        513.3970336914062,
        637.8016357421875
      ],
      "text": "smear-positive pulmonary TB cases to the number of HIV-positive children or children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04501342773438,
        640.4465942382812,
        513.4429931640625,
        653.798095703125
      ],
      "text": "≤5 years of age screened could be used as an indicator of the effectiveness of contact",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04501342773438,
        656.443115234375,
        122.09800720214844,
        669.7946166992188
      ],
      "text": "tracing.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04501342773438,
        680.9496459960938,
        513.39697265625,
        694.3011474609375
      ],
      "text": "BCG adverse events must also be reported - in most countries, to the Expanded",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04501342773438,
        696.9461059570312,
        231.15248107910156,
        710.297607421875
      ],
